<title>POLAND: STOMIL TURNS TO PLN 1.8 MLN LOSS IN JULY.</title>
<headline>STOMIL TURNS TO PLN 1.8 MLN LOSS IN JULY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 1.83 vs   4.28 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   2.83 vs   6.04 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 2.10 vs   6.04 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   58.98 vs  59.90</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    10.51 vs  29.28</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	10.57 vs  44.59</p>
<p> Operating profit    18.53 vs  39.96</p>
<p> Sales		  401.34 vs 374.61</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish tyre maker is Stomil Olsztyn SA</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
